msgstr "Worker node size"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/sizing/kubernetes.rst:20
msgid "За единицу расчёта принята worker-нода **16 vCPU / 32 GiB**."
msgstr "The unit of calculation is a **16 vCPU / 32 GiB** worker node."

